# Struct field offsets, sizes and vtable slots of the mac-x64 game: NAME VALUE (tools/targets/targets.py).
# Native code reads them with RC_OFF(name); a name ending in _slot is a vtable slot index (RC_SLOT).
# `NAME unsupported REASON` = no counterpart in this game.
